                  "Type": "SlideShow",
                  "Data": {
                     "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/voices_of_babylon/1/intro/%d.png",
                     "Slides": [
                        {
                           "Duration": 20.7,
                           "TextFadeDuration": 20.5,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Mesopotamia, 1760 BCE\n\nThe small city state of Babylon is growing under the energetic leadership of its new king, Hammurabi. You have been sent down river to bring some enclaves of Sumerians and Akkadians into the fold. Use your powers of persuasion when you can, but do not hesitate to resort to war if they prove to be resistant.",
                           "ImageRect": {
                              "x": 0,
                              "y": 0,
                              "width": 3840,
                              "height": 2160
