      {
         "IntroSequence": {
            "SequenceItems": [
               {
                  "Type": "SlideShow",
                  "Data": {
                     "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/voices_of_babylon/7/intro/%d.png",
                     "Slides": [
                        {
                           "Duration": 37.8,
                           "TextFadeDuration": 37.599999999999994,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "The Euphrates River, 748 – 734 BCE\n\nBabylonia has succumbed to the continuous invasions of the Aramaeans—yet another semi-nomadic tribe from the west. The empire has been reduced to poverty and our kings hold onto little more than their grand titles. Things are about to change, however—an Assyrian general named Tiglath-Pileser has rebelled against his king and has taken the throne. He is willing to support our new king Nabonassar to retake land lost to the Aramaeans, our common enemy. Nabonassar commands you to revitalize the Babylonian armies and destroy the invaders encroaching on our territory.",
                           "ImageRect": {
                              "x": 0,
                              "y": 0,
                              "width": 3840,
                              "height": 2160
                           },
                           "TextRect": {
                              "x": 230,
